@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@phone = 13900000001
@password = Test123456
@bearerToken = paste-login-token-here
@idempotencyToken = paste-idempotency-token-here
@showId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@ticketCategoryId = 2
@requestId = REQ替换为提交返回的requestId
@orderId = 1

### 使用 @phone 前，先按 phase1-auth-api.http 注册该用户；或改为本地已有账号。

### 1. 登录，复制 data.token 到 @bearerToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. 获取一次性幂等 token，复制 data.token 到 @idempotencyToken
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### 3. 提交异步下单，复制 data.requestId 到 @requestId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{idempotencyToken}}"
}

### 4. 查询异步下单结果；首次查询可能仍是 QUEUED 或 PROCESSING
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### 5. 处理完成后再次查询；SUCCESS 时复制 data.orderId 到 @orderId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### 6. 查询本人正式订单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### 7. 查询不存在的 requestId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order-requests/REQ_NOT_EXISTS
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### MySQL 精确检查
### SELECT request_id, status, order_id, fail_reason, created_at, updated_at
### FROM ticket_order_request
### WHERE request_id = '<requestId>';
